# Backend & API Map (as implemented)

Stack: NestJS + Fastify modular monolith. Global prefix **`/api/v1`**. Swagger **`/docs`** on core-api, integration, reporting, realtime (not api-gateway).

## Deployables (`backend/apps/`)

| App | Port | Role |
|---|---|---|
| `api-gateway` | 4000 | Entry/proxy to core-api; blocks `/internal` |
| `core-api` | 4001 | All domain Nest modules |
| `background-worker` | 4002 | Outbox poll, webhook process, KPI refresh |
| `integration-gateway` | 4003 | Webhooks, SMS/payment adapters, ANPR, iClock |
| `realtime-gateway` | 4004 | SSE events (MQTT bridge **not coded yet**) |
| `reporting-service` | 4005 | KPIs, dashboards, exports |
| `vision-ai-service` | 8000 | FastAPI ANPR/CCTV stubs |
| `analytics-ai-service` | 8001 | FastAPI forecast/anomaly stubs |

