## Auth & events (reality)

- `AUTH_MODE`: `local` | `dual` (default) | `keycloak` — local HS256 + Keycloak RS256; AuthZ from **Prisma** roles/permissions
- Events today: **DB outbox → worker → HTTP** to integration-gateway (RabbitMQ infra up; Nest AMQP publish deferred)
- MQTT/EMQX infra up; **no Nest MQTT client yet** — devices via HTTP/device-api/iClock
- Integrations often **console** SMS/payment adapters until vendors wired

## When coding backend

Extend the owning lib; wire via `core-api` `AppModule`; no new microservice per portal; no cross-lib repository calls.
